  "_comment": [
    "The dotmac-kernel catalogue at v0.1.0a102, read out of the tag's own",
    "packages/dotmac-kernel/src/dotmac_kernel/__init__.py and recorded here so a",
    "Governance test measures a product against the REAL Kernel rather than",
    "against a catalogue derived from what that product happened to import.",
    "",
    "The three lists are three separate publication authorities and are NOT",
    "interchangeable. supported_modules and internal_modules enumerate",
    "SUBMODULES; the bare 'dotmac_kernel' is in neither, which is the whole of",
    "the defect this fixture exists to hold fixed. root_exports is the root",
    "facade's own authority -- the module's __all__ -- and it publishes NAMES,",
    "not modules.",
    "",
    "Read-only provenance: transcribed from an immutable tag. This is not a",
    "registry attestation and says nothing about what any product installed."
  ],
